  "details": "Getting spammed with NullReferenceException every so often. My log file has over 10000 entries with just NullReferenceExceptions.\n\nHere is a snippet:\n\n```\n\n2025.02.12 11:58:17 Error      -  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\nSystem.NullReferenceException: Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\n  at ÌÌÍÍÎÎÍÍÏÏÍÏÏÌÎÎÏÌÏÍÎÌÎ.ÎÏÎÍÌÎÎÏÏÌÌÍÏÎÍÎÌÍÏÌÎÌÌ () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at VRC.Networking.Pose.PoseAV2Update.LateUpdate () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n```\n\nHere is part of the log file, but I had to cut it down in size from 43,8MB to the 8MB limit of Canny.",
